 "introduction_raw": "I really reccomend you watch the instructional video:\n\n[video|http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F9QAa7oHbiE&feature=player_embedded]\n\n[http://sketchup.google.com/3dwarehouse/details?mid=1289cc9979d24e3d1211da1f85706ccd|Sketchup Model]You need to fit the cylinder into the frame so that when it is fully extended, the press foot is in the correct spot to eject the brick. You will need to torch holes in the horizontals for the pin which goes thru the cylinder, and weld DOM tubing to hold the pin.",
 "introduction_rendered": "<p>I really reccomend you watch the instructional video:</p>\n\n<div class=\"large videoFrame videoBox_center\" style=\"width:570px\"><div class=\"videoBox\"><div videoid=F9QAa7oHbiE class='youtube-player' src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/F9QAa7oHbiE?wmode=opaque\" style='background-image:url(\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/F9QAa7oHbiE/hqdefault.jpg\")' width=\"560\" height=\"315\" ></div></div></div>\n\n<p><a href=\"http://sketchup.google.com/3dwarehouse/details?mid=1289cc9979d24e3d1211da1f85706ccd\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Sketchup Model</a>You need to fit the cylinder into the frame so that when it is fully extended, the press foot is in the correct spot to eject the brick. You will need to torch holes in the horizontals for the pin which goes thru the cylinder, and weld DOM tubing to hold the pin.</p>",
